<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77888" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραγωγ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misleading, deceitful</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ πρόδοτι καὶ παραγωγέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					595
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>creative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				92.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			 (proparox.), <i>easily movable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>derived from</i> another word, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότυπος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				634.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				146.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					200.21
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				97.33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1553.35
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γως</span>
			<i>by a slight change</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.316a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.480f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>formed in parody</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Numen.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>.</div>
